   120	Here `B` is arbitrary. This also explains why a universal fold assertion for all linear-Jacobian pairs would need extra hypotheses: `(gamma*pi,gamma)` has Jacobian `-gamma` and is birational, with a contracted critical line. No complete classification of arbitrary-degree solutions to the weaker or reverse-index receiver is established in this lane. Their status is **NONEMPTY; COMPLETE ALL-DEGREE CLASSIFICATION OPEN**.
